WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:20.639 --> 00:00:24.096
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

2
00:00:24.356 --> 00:00:25.495
Salt!

3
00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:54.665
Get out of the way, freaks!

4
00:01:09.111 --> 00:01:10.210
Get out!

5
00:01:36.324 --> 00:01:39.301
- What happened?
- What's happened?

6
00:01:39.481 --> 00:01:43.293
- I don’t understand. Was he shot down? What a horror.
- Nightmare.

7
00:01:43.317 --> 00:01:46.893
- Sun Jae!
- And look at the car.

8
00:01:47.393 --> 00:01:49.051
Crap! Song Jae!

9
00:01:49.391 --> 00:01:50.969
Sun Jae, open your eyes!

10
00:01:55.105 --> 00:01:56.204
Song Jae!

11
00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:58.961
- Look how he is.
- Fine.

12
00:02:07.453 --> 00:02:10.230
Kim Young Soo, you are under arrest
for attempted kidnapping.

13
00:02:14.486 --> 00:02:15.585
Kim Young Soo!

14
00:03:15.904 --> 00:03:17.043
Song Jae.

15
00:03:17.902 --> 00:03:19.281
Song Jae.

16
00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:21.279
It's already morning.

17
00:03:21.698 --> 00:03:23.636
It's time to wake up.

18
00:03:27.173 --> 00:03:28.392
I like you.

19
00:03:31.329 --> 00:03:32.548
I'll regret...

20
00:03:33.766 --> 00:03:35.864
if I don't say it again.

21
00:03:38.442 --> 00:03:39.980
I like you, Sung Jae.

22
00:03:49.311 --> 00:03:53.482
- Salt...
- The snowfall will continue until the morning.

23
00:03:53.506 --> 00:03:56.484
Be careful, dear listeners.

24
00:03:56.543 --> 00:03:58.042
On to the next news.

25
00:03:58.182 --> 00:04:01.355
Died today in Gangnam
suspect in the case

26
00:04:01.379 --> 00:04:05.075
about attempted kidnapping.
The criminal was hiding from the police.

27
00:04:05.255 --> 00:04:08.667
The man was previously convicted
for attempted murder

28
00:04:08.691 --> 00:04:12.144
- ...at the Juyang Reservoir in 2008.
- At the reservoir?

29
00:04:12.168 --> 00:04:14.941
- The police are on the trail...
- Really...

30
00:04:14.965 --> 00:04:18.018
The criminal ran out
on the roadway,

31
00:04:18.042 --> 00:04:20.416
- ...where he was hit by a dump truck.
- Kim Young Soo...

32
00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:23.532
- It is reported that from the injuries received...
-...died?

33
00:04:23.556 --> 00:04:26.889
- Sung Jae. What about Sung Jae?
- ... the man died on the spot.

34
00:04:26.913 --> 00:04:29.451
On to the next news.

35
00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:32.883
Next week will be...

36
00:04:32.907 --> 00:04:37.319
- Hit by a car?
- Anyone can join.

37
00:04:37.343 --> 00:04:39.357
- Ryu Sun Jae was hit by a car.
- There was an accident.

38
00:04:39.381 --> 00:04:42.993
- What a nightmare!
- He is in the hospital at Wuxing University.

39
00:04:43.017 --> 00:04:44.476
At Wuxing University.

40
00:04:51.688 --> 00:04:52.947
Stop it!

41
00:05:06.633 --> 00:05:08.132
Song Jae! Song Jae!

42
00:05:26.014 --> 00:05:27.113
Sorry!

43
00:06:26.593 --> 00:06:28.012
You're whole.

44
00:06:28.711 --> 00:06:29.970
How good.

45
00:06:32.707 --> 00:06:34.006
Why did you run?

46
00:06:35.425 --> 00:06:36.763
Sung Jae, now...

47
00:06:37.502 --> 00:06:39.321
it's all really behind.

48
00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:41.439
This...

49
00:06:43.696 --> 00:06:45.515
because of the news of the accident?

50
00:06:46.613 --> 00:06:47.752
No.

51
00:06:48.092 --> 00:06:50.110
I was passing by.

52
00:06:51.528 --> 00:06:52.627
If so...

53
00:06:53.646 --> 00:06:54.745
why are you crying?

54
00:06:58.442 --> 00:07:00.100
No, I'm not crying.

55
00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.418
I have to go.

56
00:07:02.677 --> 00:07:03.816
And every day...

57
00:07:05.075 --> 00:07:06.574
did you cry alone?

58
00:07:08.591 --> 00:07:09.970
We missed that...

59
00:07:10.789 --> 00:07:12.208
who forgot you?

60
00:07:18.422 --> 00:07:19.521
Here you go.

61
00:07:21.019 --> 00:07:22.238
I told you so.

62
00:07:22.577 --> 00:07:23.836
The ending is sad.

63
00:07:26.893 --> 00:07:28.631
But you don't want to change it.

64
00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.345
What are you talking about...

65
00:07:31.369 --> 00:07:32.468
What can I do?

66
00:07:33.487 --> 00:07:34.825
Fate decided for you.

67
00:07:57.742 --> 00:07:58.841
Salt...

68
00:08:02.138 --> 00:08:03.597
I remembered everything.

69
00:08:11.528 --> 00:08:12.627
What?

70
00:08:15.764 --> 00:08:16.863
I...

71
00:08:17.363 --> 00:08:18.582
I remembered everything.

72
00:08:19.401 --> 00:08:20.619
Can't be.

73
00:08:21.199 --> 00:08:22.298
How?

74
00:08:22.957 --> 00:08:24.136
For what?

75
00:08:24.875 --> 00:08:27.129
How could you leave me?

76
00:08:27.153 --> 00:08:28.771
How can I live without you?

77
00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:31.648
Did you think I could?

78
00:08:32.148 --> 00:08:33.606
Song Jae...

79
00:08:55.365 --> 00:08:56.903
Don't cry. Fine?

80
00:09:02.078 --> 00:09:03.257
Sorry I forgot.

81
00:09:05.395 --> 00:09:06.494
Sorry...

82
00:09:08.551 --> 00:09:09.650
that I was late.

83
00:09:41.678 --> 00:09:44.695
EPISODE 16

84
00:09:47.473 --> 00:09:48.691
Song Jae...

85
00:09:49.031 --> 00:09:50.769
How long are we going to stay here?

86
00:09:53.387 --> 00:09:54.566
Just a little more.

87
00:09:55.624 --> 00:09:56.843
Until dawn?

88
00:09:58.741 --> 00:09:59.840
Until the morning.

89
00:10:02.897 --> 00:10:04.875
Grew up, but didn't get any wiser.

90
00:10:07.572 --> 00:10:10.266
We've lost so much time
while they were apart.

91
00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:13.906
I don't want to be apart anymore
not for a second.

92
00:10:16.244 --> 00:10:17.463
Fine.

93
00:10:18.641 --> 00:10:20.260
We will be together even in our dreams.

94
00:10:26.713 --> 00:10:28.412
I will remember every moment...

95
00:10:29.231 --> 00:10:30.729
spent with you.

96
00:10:31.269 --> 00:10:32.368
And even if...

97
00:10:32.747 --> 00:10:34.246
you will erase my memory...

98
00:10:34.466 --> 00:10:35.804
I will definitely...

99
00:10:36.064 --> 00:10:37.443
I'll remember everything again.

100
00:10:43.816 --> 00:10:45.315
This won't happen again.

101
00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:51.549
By the way...

102
00:10:52.248 --> 00:10:56.224
I think I haven't forgotten you.

103
00:10:56.404 --> 00:10:58.062
I never forgot.

104
00:11:03.756 --> 00:11:06.853
Sun Jae, we're already late.

105
00:11:07.113 --> 00:11:08.252
Are you crying?

106
00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:11.888
Why cry?

107
00:11:12.428 --> 00:11:13.527
Song Jae!

108
00:11:16.583 --> 00:11:17.802
Did you cry?

109
00:11:17.902 --> 00:11:19.001
Like this.

110
00:11:19.461 --> 00:11:23.397
Let my brain forget you -
the heart always remembered.

111
00:11:25.814 --> 00:11:27.952
My grandmother once told me:

112
00:11:28.172 --> 00:11:30.550
"Memories don't disappear.

113
00:11:30.729 --> 00:11:32.588
The heart cherishes them."

114
00:11:34.166 --> 00:11:35.784
And it's true.

115
00:11:55.265 --> 00:11:56.843
He found his owner.

116
00:12:04.496 --> 00:12:06.150
Interesting.

117
00:12:06.174 --> 00:12:10.230
In 15 years you have learned to manage
with locks?

118
00:12:10.529 --> 00:12:14.905
Then I suffered for a long time,
and now everything worked out the first time.

119
00:12:16.324 --> 00:12:19.496
I told you, I act in melodramas!

120
00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:21.375
What a fool you have to be

121
00:12:21.399 --> 00:12:23.976
so that for so many hours of filming
won't learn?

122
00:12:25.435 --> 00:12:28.891
Nothing. 15 years have passed.

123
00:12:29.550 --> 00:12:31.169
Anything is possible.

124
00:12:33.826 --> 00:12:36.244
Come on. Can you be jealous?

125
00:12:37.263 --> 00:12:38.601
I'm not jealous!

126
00:12:39.021 --> 00:12:40.955
So many different rumors.

127
00:12:40.979 --> 00:12:42.917
Of course, you could have done it on set...

128
00:12:47.852 --> 00:12:49.467
Let me finish!

129
00:12:49.491 --> 00:12:51.549
He said it himself...

130
00:12:52.807 --> 00:12:55.624
You can't be friends with girls.

131
00:12:56.004 --> 00:12:57.103
What next?

132
00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.978
Don't know. I forgot everything.

133
00:13:13.147 --> 00:13:14.246
I love you.

134
00:13:17.502 --> 00:13:19.201
And I you, Sung Jae.

135
00:13:38.202 --> 00:13:39.501
How are you, poor fellow?

136
00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:41.658
What destinies?

137
00:13:42.158 --> 00:13:43.896
I came to you, idiot.

138
00:13:44.715 --> 00:13:47.493
Your case has caused so much noise.

139
00:13:50.190 --> 00:13:53.766
The murder weapon was found in the trunk of the taxi.

140
00:13:54.386 --> 00:13:56.004
Everything is clear with this freak.

141
00:13:56.464 --> 00:13:57.602
I knew it.

142
00:13:58.262 --> 00:14:00.196
In 2008 I said

143
00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:02.677
that he should be imprisoned for life.

144
00:14:02.817 --> 00:14:04.276
I spoke.

145
00:14:04.496 --> 00:14:06.949
Do bastards like this ever change?

146
00:14:06.973 --> 00:14:08.472
The devil in the flesh.

147
00:14:09.171 --> 00:14:11.948
Don't call everyone devils.

148
00:14:12.208 --> 00:14:14.466
He's just a fucking psychopath.

149
00:14:17.403 --> 00:14:20.260
I’m convinced myself that anything can happen in life.

150
00:14:20.519 --> 00:14:22.178
Just don't think...

151
00:14:22.637 --> 00:14:23.736
that you are to blame.

152
00:14:23.996 --> 00:14:25.814
This is his fate.

153
00:14:26.354 --> 00:14:30.050
But how many destinies are saved
thanks to his death.

154
00:14:36.344 --> 00:14:37.443
Maybe.

155
00:14:43.976 --> 00:14:45.031
Crap.

156
00:14:45.055 --> 00:14:48.951
A MONTH LATER

157
00:14:52.048 --> 00:14:54.186
- Thank you.
- Please.

158
00:15:01.838 --> 00:15:03.017
When will you finish?

159
00:15:12.228 --> 00:15:15.281
Don't know. I definitely won't finish today.

160
00:15:15.305 --> 00:15:16.404
What?

161
00:15:17.702 --> 00:15:19.920
So we won't see you today?

162
00:15:27.213 --> 00:15:29.391
I have work for two days.

163
00:15:29.491 --> 00:15:31.109
I'll call you when I get out.

164
00:15:31.489 --> 00:15:32.588
Bye!

165
00:15:33.287 --> 00:15:35.624
I miss you too, Sung Jae...

166
00:15:35.964 --> 00:15:37.583
but nothing can be done.

167
00:15:38.601 --> 00:15:41.539
You won't be offended?

168
00:15:50.549 --> 00:15:52.603
- Ryu Sung Jae?
- Ryu Sung Jae?

169
00:15:52.627 --> 00:15:54.042
- Look!
- It's really him!

170
00:15:54.066 --> 00:15:57.119
- Ryu Sung Jae!
- He really is!

171
00:15:57.143 --> 00:16:01.359
My God, my God! Go crazy!

172
00:16:07.572 --> 00:16:09.471
Wow!

173
00:16:10.569 --> 00:16:12.543
This is Ryu Sung Jae!

174
00:16:12.567 --> 00:16:13.986
I miss you.

175
00:16:15.165 --> 00:16:16.424
Are you crazy?

176
00:16:20.799 --> 00:16:21.898
Hello.

177
00:16:36.344 --> 00:16:38.118
I didn't order this.

178
00:16:38.142 --> 00:16:40.480
- This is from Ryu Sung Jae.
- What?

179
00:16:40.899 --> 00:16:43.033
I would sit quietly.

180
00:16:43.057 --> 00:16:45.990
He decided to treat all the guests.

181
00:16:46.014 --> 00:16:47.113
What?

182
00:16:48.052 --> 00:16:50.186
Sun Jae cares about the fans!

183
00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:52.787
Take a photo of me, take a photo.

184
00:17:02.118 --> 00:17:03.856
Are you serious?

185
00:17:05.754 --> 00:17:07.812
Refresh yourself and keep working.

186
00:17:08.511 --> 00:17:10.410
I don't think I can.

187
00:17:18.781 --> 00:17:21.079
Then maybe you can sit with me?

188
00:17:24.655 --> 00:17:28.472
What kind of person am I? When will I finish this?

189
00:17:44.196 --> 00:17:48.408
Ryu Sung Jae! Ryu Sung Jae!
Can I have your autograph, please?

190
00:17:48.432 --> 00:17:52.248
Can I take a photo with you?
Can I take a photo?

191
00:18:04.016 --> 00:18:05.710
Did you follow me here too?

192
00:18:05.734 --> 00:18:07.393
Where else can we meet...

193
00:18:07.532 --> 00:18:09.031
if you're busy?

194
00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.824
What if someone recognizes you?

195
00:18:11.848 --> 00:18:13.866
I'm wearing a mask. Who will recognize me?

196
00:18:15.285 --> 00:18:17.423
Work. I'll look through the books for now.

197
00:18:38.581 --> 00:18:40.879
You were going to leaf through books.

198
00:18:40.979 --> 00:18:42.078
You know...

199
00:18:42.577 --> 00:18:43.996
I suddenly remembered...

200
00:18:44.336 --> 00:18:45.674
...university.

201
00:18:46.414 --> 00:18:47.513
What?

202
00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:50.829
And it's true.

203
00:18:52.448 --> 00:18:53.986
Secret date.

204
00:18:54.046 --> 00:18:56.743
Is this a film set here?

205
00:18:57.083 --> 00:19:00.300
Have your own secret dates
somewhere else...

206
00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:02.697
Ryu Sung Jae.

207
00:19:04.915 --> 00:19:08.851
This... This... This...
This is not Ryu Sung Jae. This...

208
00:19:09.351 --> 00:19:11.169
...my brother, my own brother.

209
00:19:11.429 --> 00:19:13.407
Lim Sol, Lim Geum.

210
00:19:14.585 --> 00:19:17.762
He is often told that he looks like
on Ryu Sung Jae.

211
00:19:19.101 --> 00:19:21.159
Let's go, my brother.

212
00:19:25.894 --> 00:19:28.152
A book. The book is in place.

213
00:19:36.723 --> 00:19:39.141
Okay, give this to your brother.

214
00:19:41.119 --> 00:19:43.572
And where should I work now?

215
00:19:43.596 --> 00:19:46.410
Nephews make noise at home - this is not an option.

216
00:19:46.434 --> 00:19:49.566
Don't rush. I can ask
to filming

217
00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:51.608
postponed to next year.

218
00:19:51.708 --> 00:19:52.847
What are you doing?

219
00:19:54.386 --> 00:19:57.403
I promised to hand in the draft tomorrow.

220
00:20:00.739 --> 00:20:02.957
They might see us. It's time for you, Sung Jae.

221
00:20:03.097 --> 00:20:04.236
Then I...

222
00:20:06.533 --> 00:20:07.868
I'll take you...

223
00:20:07.892 --> 00:20:09.591
to one quiet place.

224
00:20:12.767 --> 00:20:13.866
Where?

225
00:20:18.362 --> 00:20:21.499
What? That very quiet place -

226
00:20:22.997 --> 00:20:24.895
- ...your apartment?
- Certainly.

227
00:20:25.195 --> 00:20:27.053
Nowhere is so quiet.

228
00:20:31.948 --> 00:20:33.522
OK.

229
00:20:33.546 --> 00:20:36.444
You don't want to be apart even for a second.

230
00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:41.079
Are you coming in?

231
00:20:43.856 --> 00:20:45.471
Why is he in such a hurry?

232
00:20:45.495 --> 00:20:47.792
Oh my God, how funny.

233
00:20:51.129 --> 00:20:52.184
Attention! Attention! Attention!

234
00:20:52.208 --> 00:20:58.138
The first work will be shown soon
actor Lim Geum.

235
00:20:58.162 --> 00:21:03.053
My God. They took him into the crowd again,
and he burst out.

236
00:21:03.077 --> 00:21:04.252
And don't talk.

237
00:21:04.276 --> 00:21:07.209
An acquaintance who called him
for an audition, disappeared.

238
00:21:07.233 --> 00:21:09.806
- Yes?
- I auditioned myself

239
00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:11.325
and got the role.

240
00:21:11.349 --> 00:21:14.641
I'm a second generation major!
The main character's husband!

241
00:21:14.665 --> 00:21:16.479
God, God. Is it true?

242
00:21:16.503 --> 00:21:19.077
Were you cast as the main character's husband?

243
00:21:19.101 --> 00:21:21.235
What's up? This is no longer a joke!

244
00:21:21.259 --> 00:21:23.636
Yes, yes, yes. Let's see. Let's see. All!

245
00:21:24.935 --> 00:21:26.034
It's starting.

246
00:21:26.294 --> 00:21:27.393
Come on!

247
00:21:34.446 --> 00:21:35.864
Brother!

248
00:21:36.484 --> 00:21:37.902
It's brother!

249
00:21:38.282 --> 00:21:39.337
It's you?

250
00:21:39.361 --> 00:21:40.779
Are you lying in bed?

251
00:21:41.838 --> 00:21:42.973
Yes, yes.

252
00:21:42.997 --> 00:21:44.096
Son!

253
00:21:44.396 --> 00:21:45.854
Yes, yes, yes!

254
00:21:45.954 --> 00:21:48.292
What kind of business is this, my love?

255
00:21:48.511 --> 00:21:51.884
No wonder you dreamed of becoming an actor for 10 years!

256
00:21:51.908 --> 00:21:53.762
Here you go. I told you...

257
00:21:53.786 --> 00:21:56.440
that one day they will show me on TV!

258
00:21:56.464 --> 00:21:59.317
My God. It's good that I survived
until this day.

259
00:21:59.341 --> 00:22:00.999
I saw you in the series.

260
00:22:01.099 --> 00:22:03.317
Everything is quiet. Let's look, look.

261
00:22:14.685 --> 00:22:16.584
Nothing will happen?

262
00:22:17.363 --> 00:22:18.701
Don't worry.

263
00:22:19.441 --> 00:22:20.739
My husband...

264
00:22:20.959 --> 00:22:23.257
fell asleep forever.

265
00:22:27.433 --> 00:22:29.287
Are you dating someone else, shameless?

266
00:22:29.311 --> 00:22:31.608
My son is still alive!

267
00:22:31.788 --> 00:22:32.887
Rubbish!

268
00:22:33.746 --> 00:22:35.241
Humble yourself already!

269
00:22:35.265 --> 00:22:38.517
Here. My husband. Your son.

270
00:22:38.541 --> 00:22:40.639
He is no better than a dead man!

271
00:22:41.379 --> 00:22:42.677
Come here, creature!

272
00:22:43.297 --> 00:22:44.955
It probably hurts.

273
00:22:48.731 --> 00:22:52.827
Is that all? You've never even
didn't get up, dear.

274
00:22:53.127 --> 00:22:56.899
You've been so wrapped in bandages,
that the mother will not know.

275
00:22:56.923 --> 00:22:58.861
- When will they be removed?
- They won't take it off.

276
00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:01.814
I'll just die in the last episode.

277
00:23:01.838 --> 00:23:04.252
Look at the title.
"While my husband is sleeping."

278
00:23:04.276 --> 00:23:05.570
I won't wake up.

279
00:23:05.594 --> 00:23:07.053
- Yes?
- And what?

280
00:23:11.988 --> 00:23:13.487
What's happened?

281
00:23:15.664 --> 00:23:20.356
Yes, this is the first series in your career.
Played great for the first time.

282
00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:23.952
- Well done!
- Yes, yes! This is just the beginning.

283
00:23:23.976 --> 00:23:26.350
The main thing is to try
and there will be more roles!

284
00:23:26.374 --> 00:23:27.748
Exactly.

285
00:23:27.772 --> 00:23:31.584
By the way, dear, how did you manage
don't move for a couple of minutes?

286
00:23:31.608 --> 00:23:35.744
I fell into a oh-so-deep sleep
but then they doused me with water,

287
00:23:35.804 --> 00:23:37.423
and I just lay there.

288
00:23:37.602 --> 00:23:39.297
Changed tactics. Is this visible?

289
00:23:39.321 --> 00:23:40.695
Certainly!

290
00:23:40.719 --> 00:23:43.413
I noticed how your eyelids were trembling.
Is it true!

291
00:23:43.437 --> 00:23:46.290
- Yes, yes!
- Incredible acting skills,

292
00:23:46.314 --> 00:23:50.086
dear.
Your nose looked great in the shot.

293
00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:51.209
Seriously?

294
00:23:52.268 --> 00:23:56.160
Come on. The director said,
that I am the most beautiful of the whole team.

295
00:23:56.184 --> 00:23:57.922
Is it true?

296
00:23:59.500 --> 00:24:02.438
My God, you have found each other. Exactly.

297
00:24:13.926 --> 00:24:18.058
Strange. He took me to his home
and sits quietly.

298
00:24:18.082 --> 00:24:19.461
At least it would fit.

299
00:24:28.152 --> 00:24:29.650
That's it, yes.

300
00:24:29.790 --> 00:24:32.048
You can also take time away from work.

301
00:24:47.852 --> 00:24:49.591
Eat. I won't interfere.

302
00:24:50.529 --> 00:24:51.628
Work.

303
00:24:57.842 --> 00:24:58.941
What?

304
00:24:59.401 --> 00:25:01.059
Does he say work?

305
00:25:14.426 --> 00:25:15.525
Where is Sun Jae?

306
00:25:19.461 --> 00:25:20.795
Wow!

307
00:25:20.819 --> 00:25:23.037
I'm done working!

308
00:25:26.573 --> 00:25:29.626
Finally finished!

309
00:25:29.650 --> 00:25:30.869
Eat!

310
00:25:34.366 --> 00:25:35.465
What?

311
00:25:57.263 --> 00:25:58.362
Song Jae...

312
00:26:01.099 --> 00:26:02.518
Already finished?

313
00:26:02.617 --> 00:26:03.716
What?

314
00:26:03.896 --> 00:26:05.590
- Yes.
- Here you go.

315
00:26:05.614 --> 00:26:07.712
I told you you could do it.

316
00:26:08.012 --> 00:26:10.110
And it's true. I thought I wouldn't make it in time.

317
00:26:23.357 --> 00:26:24.855
Certainly.

318
00:26:25.195 --> 00:26:26.933
Wants to come over.

319
00:26:33.626 --> 00:26:35.045
Did you like the food?

320
00:26:36.783 --> 00:26:38.162
Let's go. I'll take you.

321
00:26:43.137 --> 00:26:44.276
Will he take you?

322
00:26:44.735 --> 00:26:45.994
Already?

323
00:26:50.689 --> 00:26:53.786
Distracted me all day.
What came over him?

324
00:26:55.564 --> 00:26:56.663
Did you take everything?

325
00:27:02.358 --> 00:27:03.696
Let's go. It's too late.

326
00:27:06.793 --> 00:27:09.650
Me too. It's only eleven o'clock.

327
00:27:10.190 --> 00:27:11.968
Am I 18?

328
00:27:13.027 --> 00:27:14.442
My God!

329
00:27:14.466 --> 00:27:17.922
What is it? Everything... Everything fell out.

330
00:27:21.898 --> 00:27:24.356
I forgot my keys. Wait. I'll be quick.

331
00:27:34.645 --> 00:27:38.102
If it were the end of the world, it would still
sent me out.

332
00:27:38.721 --> 00:27:41.019
I finished my work.

333
00:27:41.159 --> 00:27:43.537
We could have sat a little longer.

334
00:27:48.831 --> 00:27:50.130
What about staying at home?

335
00:27:51.349 --> 00:27:53.686
Staying home is not an option?

336
00:27:54.466 --> 00:27:56.164
I knew it.

337
00:27:57.942 --> 00:28:01.399
Fine. If you want me to stay...

338
00:28:01.499 --> 00:28:02.917
...I'll stay.

339
00:28:04.855 --> 00:28:07.548
Song Jae! What does "stay" mean?

340
00:28:07.572 --> 00:28:10.390
We've all gathered. Come quickly!

341
00:28:12.088 --> 00:28:14.462
I... I... I... Not like that...

342
00:28:14.486 --> 00:28:17.183
I didn't understand it that way.

343
00:28:19.401 --> 00:28:21.219
I'll call a taxi now!

344
00:28:29.750 --> 00:28:31.888
Where? You're staying.

345
00:28:32.268 --> 00:28:35.520
No. I thought you were with me
talking.

346
00:28:35.544 --> 00:28:37.842
If so, would you stay?

347
00:28:38.581 --> 00:28:42.038
Yes, I would stay the night. Yes.

348
00:28:42.537 --> 00:28:46.034
I have so much work to do
that we don’t have time to see each other.

349
00:28:46.214 --> 00:28:50.026
We'd have dinner, watch a movie,
lie down.

350
00:28:50.050 --> 00:28:51.149
Did you lie down?

351
00:28:51.528 --> 00:28:54.026
We lay there, and also... More...

352
00:28:54.326 --> 00:28:57.503
Yes. Exactly. Would turn it on
something interesting...

353
00:28:58.362 --> 00:29:00.180
and would chat.

354
00:29:00.719 --> 00:29:02.094
And would we chat?

355
00:29:02.118 --> 00:29:04.651
But on the other hand, it's already too late.

356
00:29:04.675 --> 00:29:06.489
Yes. It's time to go home.

357
00:29:06.513 --> 00:29:10.050
And go to bed.

358
00:29:10.110 --> 00:29:11.209
So?

359
00:29:11.548 --> 00:29:12.603
Are you staying?

360
00:29:12.627 --> 00:29:15.285
I'm staying, but don't misunderstand...

361
00:29:15.904 --> 00:29:17.003
Okay.

362
00:29:17.063 --> 00:29:18.238
Anything you want.

363
00:29:18.262 --> 00:29:20.955
Let's have dinner, watch a movie,
some show.

364
00:29:20.979 --> 00:29:22.078
What else?

365
00:29:22.378 --> 00:29:24.472
- Shall we chat?
- Yes. Yes. Let's chat!

366
00:29:24.496 --> 00:29:25.834
Fine. Agreed.

367
00:29:26.254 --> 00:29:27.353
But...

368
00:29:27.932 --> 00:29:29.031
first this.

369
00:31:15.944 --> 00:31:17.043
Song Jae...

370
00:31:31.369 --> 00:31:32.508
I love you too.

371
00:31:33.726 --> 00:31:34.825
Are you awake?

372
00:31:34.965 --> 00:31:36.064
I'm sleeping.

373
00:31:37.403 --> 00:31:39.860
No, you're not sleeping.

374
00:31:40.559 --> 00:31:42.418
You said you would leave tomorrow.

375
00:31:45.195 --> 00:31:46.933
Tomorrow has already arrived.

376
00:31:48.032 --> 00:31:50.530
It won't come until we wake up.

377
00:31:51.149 --> 00:31:54.561
You come up with new excuses,
to stall for time.

378
00:31:54.585 --> 00:31:56.843
I know everything!

379
00:31:57.183 --> 00:31:59.756
No. I get up. I give up! I give up!

380
00:31:59.780 --> 00:32:01.119
I'm getting up! I give up!

381
00:32:01.259 --> 00:32:02.358
I give up.

382
00:32:22.438 --> 00:32:24.296
Why are you looking like that?

383
00:32:24.675 --> 00:32:26.693
I have something in my eye?

384
00:32:29.870 --> 00:32:30.969
What?

385
00:32:36.663 --> 00:32:37.842
I'm kidding.

386
00:32:40.539 --> 00:32:42.118
Seriously?

387
00:32:44.376 --> 00:32:45.595
Too beautiful.

388
00:32:56.763 --> 00:32:58.222
I can't believe it...

389
00:32:59.840 --> 00:33:00.939
what...

390
00:33:01.479 --> 00:33:02.578
it's true.

391
00:33:03.916 --> 00:33:05.015
Me too.

392
00:33:08.192 --> 00:33:09.531
Sometimes I'm afraid...

393
00:33:10.270 --> 00:33:11.369
what are you...

394
00:33:11.708 --> 00:33:13.726
you'll run away again at another time.

395
00:33:14.146 --> 00:33:15.245
And then...

396
00:33:16.144 --> 00:33:17.243
I'm again...

397
00:33:17.542 --> 00:33:18.881
I'll forget you.

398
00:33:28.691 --> 00:33:30.350
This won't happen.

399
00:33:32.527 --> 00:33:34.586
- Is it true?
- Is it true.

400
00:33:34.925 --> 00:33:36.619
I won't run away anywhere.

401
00:33:36.643 --> 00:33:37.902
The watch is missing.

402
00:33:39.041 --> 00:33:42.214
- Exactly.
- By the way, where did yours go?

403
00:33:42.238 --> 00:33:43.337
No idea.

404
00:33:43.756 --> 00:33:46.254
I lost them a long time ago. I don't know where they are.

405
00:33:46.553 --> 00:33:47.932
Maybe they are somewhere.

406
00:33:48.232 --> 00:33:49.531
Maybe they were picked up.

407
00:33:49.790 --> 00:33:53.083
And I paid 3000 for them. It's a pity.

408
00:33:53.107 --> 00:33:54.481
I had to pick it up.

409
00:33:54.505 --> 00:33:56.004
They are no longer needed.

410
00:33:57.982 --> 00:34:00.120
I will always be there.

411
00:34:03.457 --> 00:34:05.395
This is good.

412
00:34:05.814 --> 00:34:07.832
But maybe it's time to get up?

413
00:34:08.971 --> 00:34:10.110
Five more minutes.

414
00:34:11.249 --> 00:34:12.987
No, ten.

415
00:34:14.006 --> 00:34:15.944
No. Half an hour!

416
00:34:32.707 --> 00:34:35.365
Mother! What are you doing there? Let's go.

417
00:34:37.423 --> 00:34:41.798
Fine. Wait for me, little sister!

418
00:35:02.278 --> 00:35:04.176
I want to wash my face, come out.

419
00:35:04.595 --> 00:35:05.694
Fine.

420
00:35:08.312 --> 00:35:09.690
Maybe stay?

421
00:35:09.830 --> 00:35:11.564
Come out, I say!

422
00:35:11.588 --> 00:35:14.126
- Come out!
- Suddenly you're scared.

423
00:35:18.342 --> 00:35:20.360
Song Jae! I'm leaving!

424
00:35:21.179 --> 00:35:22.438
Won't you have breakfast?

425
00:35:22.537 --> 00:35:25.510
CEO Lee is waiting for me,
It's time to go!

426
00:35:25.534 --> 00:35:26.633
Wait!

427
00:35:29.570 --> 00:35:31.229
Here. Take it with you.

428
00:35:34.166 --> 00:35:35.585
I would take you.

429
00:35:36.124 --> 00:35:38.857
Let's go out together and we'll get caught again.

430
00:35:38.881 --> 00:35:40.340
- I'm leaving!
- Wait!

431
00:35:41.479 --> 00:35:42.657
So will you go?

432
00:35:44.116 --> 00:35:45.215
Exactly.

433
00:35:45.794 --> 00:35:47.049
That's it, I'm leaving.

434
00:35:47.073 --> 00:35:48.172
Wait!

435
00:35:49.590 --> 00:35:50.689
Have you forgotten anything?

436
00:35:53.467 --> 00:35:54.566
Are you satisfied?

437
00:35:56.224 --> 00:35:59.401
By the way, we look like newlyweds.

438
00:36:00.819 --> 00:36:02.877
That's it, that's it. Bye!

439
00:36:08.252 --> 00:36:09.551
For newlyweds?

440
00:36:11.049 --> 00:36:13.906
Yes. You can't even see her face.

441
00:36:16.643 --> 00:36:18.342
Library date.

442
00:36:19.081 --> 00:36:22.018
It’s immediately obvious that the girl is decent and smart.

443
00:36:22.358 --> 00:36:27.493
He then took her to his home.
Fell head over heels in love, asshole.

444
00:36:31.948 --> 00:36:35.001
Come on. Who would have thought?

445
00:36:35.025 --> 00:36:41.319
You can't even see her face, but she's beautiful
you can feel it through the screen!

446
00:36:42.577 --> 00:36:44.795
Sun Jae is going crazy!

447
00:36:48.292 --> 00:36:50.545
Worked with the most beautiful
women of the world

448
00:36:50.569 --> 00:36:52.108
and didn’t even bat an eyelid.

449
00:36:52.567 --> 00:36:54.546
Where did he find this one?

450
00:36:55.045 --> 00:36:57.103
It's obvious that she's not pretty.

451
00:36:58.961 --> 00:37:02.058
Maybe there's something wrong with her?

452
00:37:08.871 --> 00:37:11.688
Song Jae... Song Jae, we still have a long time to go
stand like that?

453
00:37:12.108 --> 00:37:14.162
My fingers are already hurting.

454
00:37:14.186 --> 00:37:17.523
None of these rings fit
under the style Salt.

455
00:37:18.741 --> 00:37:21.319
What kind of style does your Sol have?

456
00:37:22.458 --> 00:37:23.557
Now.

457
00:37:32.128 --> 00:37:34.422
I warn you, it's blinding.

458
00:37:34.446 --> 00:37:35.545
Carefully.

459
00:37:36.843 --> 00:37:37.942
Look!

460
00:37:41.399 --> 00:37:44.536
What? Sun Jae, she looks familiar.

461
00:37:45.315 --> 00:37:46.534
I saw her somewhere.

462
00:37:46.913 --> 00:37:49.287
Where would you see such a beauty?

463
00:37:49.311 --> 00:37:50.410
Wait.

464
00:37:50.749 --> 00:37:52.568
Don't give up!

465
00:37:55.864 --> 00:37:56.963
Not bad.

466
00:38:00.020 --> 00:38:02.637
- I'll take it.
- Okay, just a second.

467
00:38:04.855 --> 00:38:09.666
Yes, Sung Jae, finding a gift is,
final, important matter.

468
00:38:09.690 --> 00:38:12.464
But so many articles have already been published about you.
It's dangerous!

469
00:38:12.488 --> 00:38:15.385
Do you want to announce your wedding?

470
00:38:15.485 --> 00:38:17.219
- Just no articles.
- Yes.

471
00:38:17.243 --> 00:38:19.297
What? What are you talking about?

472
00:38:19.321 --> 00:38:21.978
Are you really going to announce your marriage?

473
00:38:22.158 --> 00:38:23.373
Does the CEO know?

474
00:38:23.397 --> 00:38:24.576
He will find out.

475
00:38:24.755 --> 00:38:26.214
- From you.
- Yes?

476
00:38:31.269 --> 00:38:33.762
Are you serious? Are you getting married?

477
00:38:33.786 --> 00:38:36.559
I don't want to part with Sol anymore
not for a second.

478
00:38:36.583 --> 00:38:39.716
Wait. Relationships are one thing
marriage is different!

479
00:38:39.740 --> 00:38:41.718
Do I look like an idiot?

480
00:38:41.858 --> 00:38:45.075
So first I will make a proposal.

481
00:38:45.734 --> 00:38:47.992
Do you think that's enough?

482
00:38:48.531 --> 00:38:50.270
Have you been to her house?

483
00:38:52.607 --> 00:38:53.706
No.

484
00:38:54.725 --> 00:38:56.424
God...

485
00:38:58.002 --> 00:38:59.101
Listen...

486
00:38:59.321 --> 00:39:01.339
how would you survive without me?

487
00:39:01.838 --> 00:39:03.297
Have you proposed?

488
00:39:03.556 --> 00:39:05.774
Me too, advisor.

489
00:39:07.512 --> 00:39:09.491
- Yes, Sol.
- Where are you?

490
00:39:09.630 --> 00:39:10.729
I?

491
00:39:10.829 --> 00:39:12.687
- Now co...
- No.

492
00:39:13.387 --> 00:39:15.684
Concert! We are rehearsing.

493
00:39:16.304 --> 00:39:17.483
I'm at In Hyuk's.

494
00:39:17.582 --> 00:39:19.401
I went to his studio.

495
00:39:19.700 --> 00:39:20.799
Do you hear?

496
00:39:21.379 --> 00:39:22.553
Sing something!

497
00:39:22.577 --> 00:39:26.354
Right now I'm running to you...

498
00:39:29.011 --> 00:39:31.229
- How many times...
- Come.

499
00:39:34.206 --> 00:39:35.984
What should we do?

500
00:39:36.963 --> 00:39:38.697
We could have tried.

501
00:39:38.721 --> 00:39:40.300
Ugly washed out.

502
00:39:40.999 --> 00:39:43.776
- It doesn't matter.
- Nobody will recognize you.

503
00:39:43.916 --> 00:39:45.371
They covered all the beauty.

504
00:39:45.395 --> 00:39:47.892
Is this important now?

505
00:39:49.590 --> 00:39:50.689
Don't worry.

506
00:39:50.749 --> 00:39:52.044
I'll solve everything.

507
00:39:52.068 --> 00:39:53.766
And how will you decide?

508
00:39:55.465 --> 00:39:58.641
- I...
- Remember the most important thing.

509
00:39:58.941 --> 00:40:00.240
It's a secret.

510
00:40:00.380 --> 00:40:02.598
Once she understands...

511
00:40:02.817 --> 00:40:04.316
you're finished.

512
00:40:04.376 --> 00:40:08.587
So until you pull out the ring,
don't show it.

513
00:40:08.611 --> 00:40:09.750
Remember, Sung Jae.

514
00:40:10.370 --> 00:40:12.543
E-tai-na.

515
00:40:12.567 --> 00:40:13.666
It's a secret.

516
00:40:13.966 --> 00:40:16.663
Well, I'll figure it out somehow.

517
00:40:17.243 --> 00:40:18.621
Don't worry.

518
00:40:19.161 --> 00:40:20.659
It's not about me.

519
00:40:21.079 --> 00:40:24.052
I'm worried you'll have problems.

520
00:40:24.076 --> 00:40:25.894
Is this why you called me?

521
00:40:29.391 --> 00:40:31.249
Why are you worried?

522
00:40:34.106 --> 00:40:36.444
Don't know. Suddenly they take a picture of us.

523
00:40:38.541 --> 00:40:39.640
Go already.

524
00:40:42.378 --> 00:40:43.597
Don't go out!

525
00:41:00.440 --> 00:41:01.539
You're late.

526
00:41:02.398 --> 00:41:03.572
Hello Taesung!

527
00:41:03.596 --> 00:41:05.495
Have you been with us? What's happened?

528
00:41:05.674 --> 00:41:07.293
It's Min Jae's holiday.

529
00:41:07.433 --> 00:41:09.051
He brought gifts for the children.

530
00:41:09.750 --> 00:41:12.288
They haven't seen you for a long time.
Are you happy?

531
00:41:12.507 --> 00:41:15.405
What do you have to do with
for this holiday?

532
00:41:16.543 --> 00:41:18.402
I am friends with my daughter-in-law Sol.

533
00:41:18.901 --> 00:41:20.839
My friend's son has a holiday.

534
00:41:25.534 --> 00:41:26.629
My God!

535
00:41:26.653 --> 00:41:28.911
Ryu Sung Jae, how did you end up here?

536
00:41:29.211 --> 00:41:31.269
What a coincidence!

537
00:41:32.727 --> 00:41:34.546
I'm not a fool, Sol.

538
00:41:35.325 --> 00:41:37.503
So many articles came out this morning.

539
00:41:37.922 --> 00:41:39.856
- Is that you?
- How did you understand?

540
00:41:39.880 --> 00:41:41.938
I find out about your boyfriend from articles.

541
00:41:43.796 --> 00:41:45.015
Maybe you can introduce me?

542
00:41:49.870 --> 00:41:52.284
You need to be careful.

543
00:41:52.308 --> 00:41:54.006
The whole neighborhood is discussing you.

544
00:41:54.545 --> 00:41:56.519
Are you jealous?

545
00:41:56.543 --> 00:41:57.642
I'm worried.

546
00:41:58.501 --> 00:42:01.838
So that you don't worry,
I'll explain everything to you.

547
00:42:02.098 --> 00:42:06.589
You're the ex she dated
two weeks. That's all.

548
00:42:06.613 --> 00:42:08.072
- It's clear?
- What?

549
