So! Get ready!

813
00:56:18.521 --> 00:56:22.454
God. What are you doing here?
Have you come to eat?

814
00:56:22.478 --> 00:56:23.577
No, dad.

815
00:56:24.356 --> 00:56:26.374
We are performing.

816
00:56:26.793 --> 00:56:28.012
Are you performing?

817
00:56:28.751 --> 00:56:31.409
- At a restaurant that serves galbi?
- What?

818
00:56:31.508 --> 00:56:33.802
Will you sing Sol for your nephew?

819
00:56:33.826 --> 00:56:35.401
Has he gone crazy?

820
00:56:35.425 --> 00:56:38.801
Hyun Soo, don't answer.
Who does he take us for?

821
00:56:41.139 --> 00:56:43.273
And I'll do some renovations in the studio.

822
00:56:43.297 --> 00:56:44.396
Listen.

823
00:56:44.775 --> 00:56:46.829
He will renovate our studio.

824
00:56:46.853 --> 00:56:49.830
- I’ll even buy you new equipment!
- Wow.

825
00:56:50.210 --> 00:56:52.588
Even the equipment will change.

826
00:56:53.207 --> 00:56:54.665
Which restaurant...

827
00:56:55.245 --> 00:56:56.344
...holiday?

828
00:56:57.123 --> 00:57:00.655
And now a gift from my future uncle.
Just a second.

829
00:57:00.679 --> 00:57:01.778
Even so?

830
00:57:02.198 --> 00:57:03.333
Wow!

831
00:57:03.357 --> 00:57:07.009
For our Prince Min Jae
the group Eclipse will sing.

832
00:57:07.033 --> 00:57:08.527
Applause!

833
00:57:08.551 --> 00:57:10.805
- Wow!
- Go crazy!

834
00:57:10.829 --> 00:57:12.248
Yes?

835
00:57:22.018 --> 00:57:25.155
Four, two, nine. Let's begin.

836
00:57:31.888 --> 00:57:36.739
Happy birthday to you, our Prince Min Jae.

837
00:57:36.763 --> 00:57:41.215
Happy birthday to you, our handsome man.

838
00:57:41.239 --> 00:57:46.250
Grow big and healthy
our beloved baby.

839
00:57:46.274 --> 00:57:51.209
Thank you very much for coming into this world.

840
00:57:55.305 --> 00:57:58.282
Call Eclipse for your birthday -
this is overkill.

841
00:57:58.342 --> 00:58:02.558
It’s impossible to get to their concert,
did you make them sing like that?

842
00:58:02.857 --> 00:58:04.516
I wanted to impress you.

843
00:58:04.815 --> 00:58:06.274
So, were you impressed?

844
00:58:07.532 --> 00:58:11.509
When I see you on TV
I can't tear myself away.

845
00:58:11.568 --> 00:58:13.467
Soon we will become related.

846
00:58:13.686 --> 00:58:14.941
That's enough, mom!

847
00:58:14.965 --> 00:58:16.783
- Well?
- Enough.

848
00:58:19.041 --> 00:58:21.335
Of course, I can't give Sol anything.

849
00:58:21.359 --> 00:58:24.452
But I'll watch you instead
our late father.

850
00:58:24.476 --> 00:58:27.488
Watch closely.

851
00:58:27.512 --> 00:58:32.404
If my sister ever cries -
you're finished.

852
00:58:32.428 --> 00:58:34.685
- This is too much.
- Do you understand me?

853
00:58:34.745 --> 00:58:36.204
Yes. Don't worry.

854
00:58:37.662 --> 00:58:39.640
I heard you are an aspiring actor.

855
00:58:39.900 --> 00:58:42.358
I hope we can work together.

856
00:58:42.937 --> 00:58:45.670
Son-in-law. I'm your fan.

857
00:58:45.694 --> 00:58:48.152
- Let's star in the same film.
- Fine.

858
00:58:49.371 --> 00:58:50.470
Do you promise?

859
00:58:52.048 --> 00:58:53.307
I promised.

860
00:58:54.525 --> 00:58:57.143
My God. Min Jae cries. Let's go.

861
00:58:57.483 --> 00:58:59.137
Yes, yes. Let's go.

862
00:58:59.161 --> 00:59:00.535
- We'll go.
- Goodbye!

863
00:59:00.559 --> 00:59:02.777
- Mother!
- Let's go. Let's go.

864
00:59:11.429 --> 00:59:12.528
Grandmother?

865
00:59:14.106 --> 00:59:16.803
Live long, dear ones.

866
00:59:18.382 --> 00:59:20.120
And happily.

867
00:59:24.695 --> 00:59:26.274
Smile.

868
00:59:34.685 --> 00:59:35.784
Thank you.

869
00:59:55.544 --> 00:59:56.643
Maybe?

870
00:59:59.860 --> 01:00:01.079
Wow!

871
01:00:08.012 --> 01:00:09.990
Why did you bring me here?

872
01:00:11.009 --> 01:00:13.706
Just. So many memories.

873
01:00:14.286 --> 01:00:15.385
That's for sure.

874
01:00:23.516 --> 01:00:24.655
Now.

875
01:00:28.711 --> 01:00:30.370
Sol, I...

876
01:00:31.389 --> 01:00:32.488
I want...

877
01:00:33.027 --> 01:00:35.680
ask... ask... ask...

878
01:00:35.704 --> 01:00:37.363
- Shall we take a photo?
- Shall we take a photo?

879
01:00:37.982 --> 01:00:39.161
- What?
- What?

880
01:00:40.859 --> 01:00:41.958
Photo...

881
01:00:45.095 --> 01:00:46.234
Let's take a photo!

882
01:00:48.492 --> 01:00:51.189
Fine. What to do? Heart?

883
01:00:59.201 --> 01:01:02.857
- The lighting is not right...
-Are you a fool? Are you a fool?

884
01:01:09.710 --> 01:01:11.768
What? What's happened?

885
01:01:19.101 --> 01:01:21.159
Are you...

886
01:01:21.938 --> 01:01:23.916
wanted to make an offer?

887
01:01:24.256 --> 01:01:27.672
- What?
- Remember the most important thing.

888
01:01:27.892 --> 01:01:30.989
E-tai-na. It's a secret.

889
01:01:32.927 --> 01:01:34.262
- No.
- Come on.

890
01:01:34.286 --> 01:01:37.339
I thought now, like in TV series,
petals will fall.

891
01:01:37.363 --> 01:01:40.859
Tong Seok will come out with a big cake.
Baek In Hyuk will dance.

892
01:01:43.037 --> 01:01:44.931
Tong Seok, come out!

893
01:01:44.955 --> 01:01:46.529
Baek In Hyuk, come out!

894
01:01:46.553 --> 01:01:48.487
- Tong Seok! Baek In Hyuk!
- Baek In Hyuk!

895
01:01:48.511 --> 01:01:51.445
- Come out!
- Baek In Hyuk!

896
01:01:51.469 --> 01:01:55.480
But I really, really didn't want to.
You don't understand.

897
01:01:55.504 --> 01:01:58.681
Oh my God, I was joking. Gotcha.

898
01:01:58.741 --> 01:01:59.840
Are you kidding?

899
01:02:01.538 --> 01:02:02.637
Funny.

900
01:02:02.777 --> 01:02:04.356
Very funny.

901
01:02:10.090 --> 01:02:13.027
Sun Jae, I wanted to say something.

902
01:02:13.846 --> 01:02:15.345
Almost nine.

903
01:02:15.844 --> 01:02:19.141
Yes. Before she figures it out, I’ll tell you.

904
01:02:19.321 --> 01:02:20.420
Salt!

905
01:02:20.799 --> 01:02:22.418
- Will you come out...
- I'll make a film!

906
01:02:23.596 --> 01:02:25.291
What? Again?

907
01:02:25.315 --> 01:02:26.773
I decided...

908
01:02:27.353 --> 01:02:28.691
make a film.

909
01:02:28.831 --> 01:02:29.930
Movie?

910
01:02:30.829 --> 01:02:33.567
Take part in the competition
short films.

911
01:02:33.986 --> 01:02:36.723
I quit and took on the script...

912
01:02:37.023 --> 01:02:38.641
because of this.

913
01:02:38.901 --> 01:02:42.198
I haven't seen anything in the cinema for a long time.
It's a shame.

914
01:02:42.418 --> 01:02:44.396
- Do you like films?
- Yes.

915
01:02:44.615 --> 01:02:47.349
I used to have two or three films
I watched it a day.

916
01:02:47.373 --> 01:02:48.991
I dreamed of becoming a director.

917
01:02:51.489 --> 01:02:52.588
Is it true?

918
01:02:53.327 --> 01:02:56.943
I'm afraid it's too late.
And I don’t believe in my strength.

919
01:02:57.602 --> 01:02:59.057
Do you remember what you said?

920
01:02:59.081 --> 01:03:00.859
Swimming has become your happiness.

921
01:03:00.999 --> 01:03:04.735
And if you hadn't started swimming,
wouldn't know it.

922
01:03:05.315 --> 01:03:07.053
And I want to try.

923
01:03:07.273 --> 01:03:08.811
Whatever happens...

924
01:03:09.910 --> 01:03:11.449
I'll be happy.

925
01:03:16.983 --> 01:03:18.681
If you're happy...

926
01:03:19.820 --> 01:03:20.919
I'm happy.

927
01:03:21.379 --> 01:03:23.273
Even if I'm busy?

928
01:03:23.297 --> 01:03:24.915
And we won't see each other?

929
01:03:25.654 --> 01:03:27.233
I will come to you.

930
01:03:28.212 --> 01:03:29.311
Support.

931
01:03:30.050 --> 01:03:31.189
Thank you.

932
01:03:32.448 --> 01:03:34.945
I think it will be hard at first.

933
01:03:35.445 --> 01:03:37.578
- We have to wait.
- Fine.

934
01:03:37.602 --> 01:03:39.381
As much as you like.

935
01:03:41.079 --> 01:03:43.213
Exactly. What did you want to say?

936
01:03:43.237 --> 01:03:44.336
I?

937
01:03:53.826 --> 01:03:54.925
No.

938
01:03:55.624 --> 01:03:56.723
Not now!

939
01:04:16.843 --> 01:04:17.942
Close your ears!

940
01:04:20.959 --> 01:04:22.098
Everything is fine.

941
01:04:22.957 --> 01:04:25.974
No, it's cold. It's cold outside.

942
01:04:30.310 --> 01:04:31.409
Leave!

943
01:04:32.827 --> 01:04:33.926
Let's!

944
01:04:42.498 --> 01:04:43.676
Cancel!

945
01:04:45.574 --> 01:04:47.433
Cancel! Cancel, I say!

946
01:04:52.847 --> 01:04:54.466
But I'm not cold.

947
01:04:55.045 --> 01:04:59.261
Come on. It's like we're in Siberia! You'll catch a cold.

948
01:05:00.000 --> 01:05:05.335
Sung Jae seems to be something
It's about to explode.

949
01:05:05.714 --> 01:05:06.813
What?

950
01:05:07.992 --> 01:05:09.850
This is my heart exploding!

951
01:05:21.419 --> 01:05:22.677
No. Where?

952
01:05:35.804 --> 01:05:37.263
Is it the right moment?

953
01:05:37.522 --> 01:05:38.621
No.

954
01:05:39.201 --> 01:05:40.420
Not now.

955
01:05:43.676 --> 01:05:45.095
FILMING THE FILM "DESIRE"

956
01:05:46.394 --> 01:05:48.052
Camera! Light!

957
01:05:48.591 --> 01:05:50.450
Take one.

958
01:05:52.388 --> 01:05:53.682
Get ready.

959
01:05:53.706 --> 01:05:54.885
Motor!

960
01:05:58.501 --> 01:06:01.319
The weather is nice today, isn't it?

961
01:06:02.178 --> 01:06:05.630
This scene will need to be changed.
I think it's like this...

962
01:06:05.654 --> 01:06:08.312
Director Lim! A trailer with coffee arrived.

963
01:06:09.011 --> 01:06:10.110
A trailer?

964
01:06:13.247 --> 01:06:14.346
Wow!

965
01:06:32.667 --> 01:06:35.720
Song Jae! Why didn't you call?

966
01:06:35.744 --> 01:06:37.403
I wanted to make a surprise.

967
01:06:42.138 --> 01:06:44.955
To be honest, it's just an excuse.

968
01:06:47.972 --> 01:06:49.351
Thank you.

969
01:06:49.610 --> 01:06:51.425
Thank you for the coffee!

970
01:06:51.449 --> 01:06:54.541
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

971
01:06:54.565 --> 01:06:58.098
So, now pretend
that you are looking at the road.

972
01:06:58.122 --> 01:06:59.461
Again.

973
01:07:01.199 --> 01:07:03.492
- My God, my God!
- It started raining!

974
01:07:03.516 --> 01:07:06.693
- Faster, faster, cameras!
- Cover it!

975
01:07:07.073 --> 01:07:12.204
- Camera! Camera! Like this. Yes.
- Cover it!

976
01:07:12.228 --> 01:07:15.285
My God! Collect everything!

977
01:07:40.919 --> 01:07:43.177
Yes, I'm still working.

978
01:07:43.237 --> 01:07:44.815
Should I take you home?

979
01:07:45.115 --> 01:07:46.214
What?

980
01:07:47.153 --> 01:07:49.646
No, I'll just call a taxi.

981
01:07:49.670 --> 01:07:52.328
Filming tomorrow. Go to bed.

982
01:07:52.468 --> 01:07:53.966
Don't come!

983
01:07:54.266 --> 01:07:56.923
Fine. Call me when you're done.

984
01:07:57.502 --> 01:07:59.161
I'll call.

985
01:08:06.214 --> 01:08:07.313
Hello!

986
01:08:08.971 --> 01:08:10.070
Are you cold?

987
01:08:12.847 --> 01:08:15.664
Why did you come? I had to go to bed.

988
01:08:16.643 --> 01:08:19.421
Yes? Maybe I should steal you?

989
01:08:22.238 --> 01:08:23.337
Gotcha!

990
01:08:30.709 --> 01:08:31.808
We've arrived.

991
01:09:15.145 --> 01:09:17.602
Finished! Finished!

992
01:09:21.658 --> 01:09:24.675
Lim Sol, finally
your baby is born!

993
01:09:25.295 --> 01:09:27.872
Lim Sol. Lim Seol, you're great.

994
01:09:29.770 --> 01:09:32.348
We haven't walked like this for a long time.

995
01:09:34.206 --> 01:09:36.743
I see you have become even cuter.

996
01:09:37.642 --> 01:09:39.620
I was waiting for my busy girlfriend.

997
01:09:40.000 --> 01:09:42.018
Everything inside me withered.

998
01:09:42.278 --> 01:09:43.537
Is it true? I'll take a look.

999
01:09:43.876 --> 01:09:47.573
- Where?
- Not here, Sol. I'll show you later.

1000
01:09:48.711 --> 01:09:50.010
What are you doing?

1001
01:09:53.267 --> 01:09:55.405
I feel free.

1002
01:09:56.623 --> 01:09:57.922
When is the premiere?

1003
01:09:58.182 --> 01:09:59.281
In a month.

1004
01:10:01.219 --> 01:10:02.637
Everything will be fine.

1005
01:10:03.057 --> 01:10:05.475
I tried not to think about it.

1006
01:10:05.934 --> 01:10:10.070
But as soon as I submitted the film,
I started to worry about my job.

1007
01:10:10.410 --> 01:10:11.948
This is not possible.

1008
01:10:14.486 --> 01:10:15.585
Maybe...

1009
01:10:16.164 --> 01:10:17.583
let's make a wish?

1010
01:10:18.921 --> 01:10:20.020
Just like before.

1011
01:10:20.999 --> 01:10:22.098
Shall we make a wish?

1012
01:11:07.113 --> 01:11:08.252
Close your eyes.

1013
01:11:30.130 --> 01:11:31.628
What did you wish for?

1014
01:11:35.365 --> 01:11:36.464
I...

1015
01:11:53.187 --> 01:11:54.685
Song Jae...

1016
01:12:03.856 --> 01:12:05.075
Salt...

1017
01:12:07.253 --> 01:12:09.311
be with me always.

1018
01:12:10.490 --> 01:12:11.589
Please.

1019
01:12:33.666 --> 01:12:35.844
I'm waiting for an answer.

1020
01:12:45.854 --> 01:12:46.953
I will.

1021
01:12:48.971 --> 01:12:50.829
I'll always be there.

1022
01:14:09.570 --> 01:14:10.709
- You too?
- You too?

1023
01:15:01.039 --> 01:15:04.096
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

1024
01:16:48.012 --> 01:16:51.225
Translated and voiced by the studio
"Mobile TV"

1025
01:16:51.249 --> 01:16:53.986
commissioned by the online cinema Ivy
in 2024.

